''PCS'' [Base Uom *], ''1'' [Base CR *], ''BAG'' [Purchase Uom *], ''5'' [Purchase CR *], ''PCS'' [Sales Uom *], ''1'' [Sales CR *], ''PCS'' [Reporting Uom *], ''1'' [Reporting CR *],
